      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "**Worker · tasks** — unified view of Asynq work.\n\n1. **OpenTelemetry (worker service)** — `worker.asynq.*` from the worker process, exported OTLP → collector → Prometheus scrape **`job=otel_collector`** on `:8889`. Histogram math uses standard PromQL (**mean** = `rate(sum)/rate(count)`, **p95** = `histogram_quantile` on `rate(bucket)`). **Durations** are stored as **milliseconds** in Prometheus; duration panels use Grafana’s **Time · milliseconds** unit so axes, tooltips, and legend **Mean / Last** auto-format (e.g. sub-second as ms, tens of seconds as s, long runs as min) instead of raw values like `34000`. **Legend keys** are `task_type` labels (variable length); those panels use a **bottom** legend table so names are not clipped on the side.\n\n2. **Loki** — `asynq task failed` JSON logs by **`task_type`** (failures only).\n\nPer-**queue** Redis metrics (`asynqmon`) live on the **Asynq queues** dashboard.\n\nIf metric names differ slightly, use **Explore → Prometheus → Metrics browser** (OTel often maps `.` → `_`).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Terminal handler completions per second (success vs failure). Rate-limit deferrals omitted from instrumentation.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "decimals": 3,
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (task_type, outcome) (rate(worker_asynq_tasks_total{job=\"otel_collector\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{task_type}} · {{outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Worker · task completions / s (OTel)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Total terminal completions (success + failure) per task type in the dashboard time range. From `worker_asynq_tasks_total` counter.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" }, "inspect": false },
          "decimals": 0,
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "task_type" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 420 }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "id": 14,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "reducers": [] },
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [{ "desc": true, "displayName": "runs" }]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (task_type) (increase(worker_asynq_tasks_total{job=\"otel_collector\"}[$__range]))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Worker · task runs total (selected range)",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": { "mode": "columns" }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true },
            "renameByName": { "Value": "runs" }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
